    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but sitting in it doesn't change anything. the weight just stays there. i feel like i'm just waiting for an end to it all, but nothing ever ends. everything just keeps looping. it feels like the only real way to actually get some peace is to just... stop everything. completely.",
