      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is okay to want to stop everything, because the pain of continuing to run is far worse than the silence of stopping. You do not have to find a new race or a new goal to feel relief; sometimes, the only way to find peace is to simply stop trying to change the world and just let the exhaustion wash over you. The fact that you are still here, even when it feels like nothing changes, is proof that you are capable of enduring something far greater than the weight you are carrying.",
